ion|1997]] | [[Ann Cryer]] | [[Labour Party (UK)|Labour]] |- |style="background-color: {{party color|Conservative Party (UK)}}" | | [[2010 United Kingdom general election|2010]] | [[Kris Hopkins]] | [[Conservative Party (UK)|Conservative]] |- |style="background-color: {{party color|Labour Party (UK)}}" | | [[2017 United Kingdom general election|2017]] | [[John Grogan (British politician)|John Grogan]] | [[Labour Party (UK)|Labour]] |- |style="background-color: {{party color|Conservative Party (UK)}}" | | [[2019 United Kingdom general election|2019]] | [[Robbie Moore (Keighley MP)|Robbie Moore]] | [[Conservative Party (UK)|Conservative]] |}
